{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490017-homebrew-standard-boons-for-completing-trials-of-supernal-denizens","id":1490017,"title":"[Homebrew] Standard Boons For Completing Trials Of Supernal Denizens","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-13T05:35:52-07:00","id":1490017,"title":"[Homebrew] Standard Boons For Completing Trials Of Supernal Denizens","content":"1) Temporary dots in the Destiny Merit equal to the Supernal Denizen's Rank, with the Doom being based on the Supernal Denizen's Ban and Bane. Furthermore, one Informed Willworker Condition for any spell that matches the symbolism of the Supernal Denizen. If Resolving this Condition results in an Exceptional Success, the Mage can choose a Persistent Arcane Condition for himself as the benefit, which also reflects the Supernal Denizen's symbolism. For examples of such Persistent Arcane Conditions, consult <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S5lA00oP8kKrYW76B0bRVn-vYyy5Hl6aKQFtCakVPck/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><b>this document</b></a>. The dots in Destiny and the Informed Willwork Condition go away at the end of the Story if not used.<br /> <br /> 2) Temporary Patronage Yantra with a dice bonus equal to the Supernal Denizen's Rank. Patronage Yantras are always reflexive and do not take up one of the Gnosis-based Yantra slots, but they can reveal who the Patron is if someone else analyzes your Signature Nimbus with Focused Mage Sight. This lasts until the end of the Story, but can be ended earlier as a reflexive action. Upon doing so, the Mage can Resolve one Paradox Condition without having to perform Pattern Scouring, as long as the number of Successes that caused the Paradox Condition does not exceed the Supernal Denizen's Rank.<br /> <br /> 3) Temporary ownership of an Artifact with a Merit Rating of [Supernal Denizen's Rank X 4]. This lasts until the end of the Story, but the Mage can return the Artifact earlier. This requires placing it inside a Demesne aligned with the appropriate Supernal Realm, and meditating for one day or one scene, whichever is shorter. The meditation requires no roll, and the Mage receives Mana equal to [His Gnosis] X [Supernal Denizen's Rank]. Leftover points of Mana automatically congeal into suitable forms of Tass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":4443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","user":"GibberingEloquence","date":". 08-13-2022, 05:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-13T13:22:56-07:00","id":1490051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490017-homebrew-standard-boons-for-completing-trials-of-supernal-denizens#post1490017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1) Temporary dots in the Destiny Merit equal to the Supernal Denizen's Rank, without a Doom. Furthermore, one Informed Willworker Condition for any spell that matches the symbolism of the Supernal Denizen. If Resolving this Condition results in an Exceptional Success, the Mage can choose a Persistent Arcane Condition for himself as the benefit, which also reflects the Supernal Denizen's symbolism. For examples of such Persistent Arcane Conditions, consult <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S5lA00oP8kKrYW76B0bRVn-vYyy5Hl6aKQFtCakVPck/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><b>this document</b></a>. The dots in Destiny and the Informed Willwork Condition go away at the end of the Story if not used.</div> </div> </div> </div>No Doom seems off-theme - it might be more appropriate to have it make a &quot;Bane&quot; appropriate to the denizen. Something that can counteract the Destiny, ala &quot;No man of woman born.&quot; <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490017-homebrew-standard-boons-for-completing-trials-of-supernal-denizens#post1490017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3) Temporary ownership of an Artifact with a Merit Rating of [Supernal Denizen's Rank X 4]. This lasts until the end of the Story, but the Mage can return the Artifact earlier. This requires placing it inside a Demesne aligned with the appropriate Supernal Realm, and meditating for one day or one scene, whichever is shorter. The meditation requires no roll, and the Mage receives Mana equal to [His Gnosis] X [Supernal Denizen's Rank]. Leftover points of Mana automatically congeal into suitable forms of Tass.</div> </div> </div> </div>This feels like a slightly weaker version of the Matter-Angel Boon. Although the ability to potentially swap it out for a new one each story is useful<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-13T13:29:46-07:00","id":1490053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490017-homebrew-standard-boons-for-completing-trials-of-supernal-denizens?p=1490051#post1490051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No Doom seems off-theme - it might be more appropriate to have it make a &quot;Bane&quot; appropriate to the denizen. Something that can counteract the Destiny, ala &quot;No man of woman born.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div> Very good point. I have included this suggestion in the original post. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.the